at error.\n- The run `09:04:56` also failed, and I did not investigate why.\n- I did not call the policy tool, since no retraining recommendation was requested.\n- I did not check the Kubernetes deployment, so I cannot say which model version is currently served.\n\n**Recommended actions**\n- Fix or replace the input file so it contains the `label` column, or re-run with a valid `dataset_path`. Any re-run needs your confirmation.\n- Check the 09:04 failed run to find its failing task.\n- Confirm with the owners whether `champion` = version 1 is still the intended production model before promoting challenger version 5. Its registry entry is only `challenger`, and it was created by a run whose data version is data-v1.0.",
